puts us in a zugzwang and wins for Black after
2.Kd3
b3
3.axb3+
Kxb3
.} hxg5 {1...h5
2.g3!
h4
3.gxh4
b3
4.axb3
.} 2. g4 {Black is in zugzwang and cannot prevent us from delivering the mate on the next move.} b3 {} 3. axb3 {} 


