{This section taught us how we can use a breakthrough to create a passed pawn that will ultimately decide the game by promoting into a queen.   Remember how you should first fix the base of the pawn chain before you attack it, and be ready to keep the defending king away by either creating a blockade, a zugzwang, or by pushing a second passed pawn.   It is now time to sharpen your skills by solving exercises.   Good luck!} 1. -- {} 


