{Remember that learning how to defend is just as important as training your attacking skills! This section taught us that we should be very careful with moving the base of our pawn chain as we might run into a breakthrough.   We also discovered that we can create either a triangle or a bowl to bolster our structure and that our king can step into the square as a last resort to stop the passed pawn.     Make sure you have these techniques ready when solving the upcoming exercises.     Good luck!} 1. -- {} 


