[Result "*"]

4. Bc2 {The h-pawn is unstoppable, which means that we should switch to the drawing mode. White already envisions a queen or a rook on h1 and spends the time that remains on building a stalemate bunker.} Kd5 {Black must protect the e4-pawn first before setting the h-pawn in motion.} 5. Ka1 {} h2 {} 6. Bb1 {The trap has been set. Black is now forced to move the pawn if they don't want to lose the e4-pawn.} h1=Q {Stalemate!
6...h1=R
leads to the same result, whereas both
6...h1=N
7.Bc2
and
6...h1=B
7.Bc2
