3. Bg4 {It might be less obvious this time, but White is about to create another stalemate trap.} h1=Q {} 4. Bxf3+ {This double attack leaves Black litte choice.} Qxf3 {} 5. a6+ {} Kc7 {Stalemate! Kholmakov (1927).} 


