[FEN "rnbqkbnr/pppppppp/8/8/8/8/PPPPPPPP/RNBQKBNR w KQkq - 0 1"]
[Result "*"]

{The previous two examples have taught us that we can neutralize the knight's defending capacity by forcing it closer to the edge, or by dropping a road block on its route.    It is now time to use these and other tools for solving the exercises.   Good luck!} 1. -- {} 


