[FEN "8/2N5/K3p3/8/k1p5/p1P5/2P2P2/8 w - - 0 3"]
[Result "*"]

3. Na8 {The knight must find a clever route to force a draw by giving perpetual check.} a2 {} 4. Nb6+ {} Ka3 {} 5. Nxc4+ {} Ka4 {} 6. Nb6+ {} Ka3 {} 7. Nc4+ {Berlinger (1989).} 


