[FEN "8/2k5/1p2R3/8/K2p4/8/1q6/8 w - - 0 1"]
[Result "*"]

1. Rc6+ {The aim of this exercise was to apply our crazy rook skills in a position where Black has two extra pawns.
We needed to cut off the king.
1.Re7+
loses because after
