{1.Qh8+ or 1.Qe6?} 1. Qh8+ {White keeps his winning chances.
He should definitely avoid
1.Qe6?
, because of
1...Rg7+!
2.Kh6
2.Kf6
Rg6+
Rh7+!
3.Kg6
Rh6+
4.Kxh6
with a stalemate.} 


