[Result "*"]

1. Qf4+ {The queen has to take a little detour to chase the black king to the a1-h8 diagonal and reach the g7-square with tempo.} Kg6 {} 2. Qg4+ {2.Qf7+
wins as well, but in a much longer line:
2...Kg5
3.Qf4+
Kh5
4.Qh4+
Kg6
5.Qg4+
Kf6
6.Qg7+
Kf5
7.Qxa1
.} Kf6 {2...Kh7
3.Qg8
.} 3. Qg7+ {The skewer decides the game.} Kf5 {} 4. Qxa1 {} 


