{Although sudden mates are quite rare in rook endings, you should always be on the lookout in case an opportunity pops up. In this section, I demonstrated how we can either use the blocking technique to prepare a mate, or to cut off the king along a rank to decide the game at once.   Exercises   These and other techniques can be used to solve the exercises. In some cases, we need clear and logical moves to finish the job. However, I must warn you that you might also encounter beautiful studies that require a fair amount of creativity.   Good luck!} 1. -- {} 


