82. Rc7 {We should lock up the king in the corner as quickly as possible!
82.Rb7+
Ka8
won for White in Sanal-Kaidanov, Titled Tuesday blitz 2023,
but Black could have saved himself with
82...Kc8!
83.Rh7
Bf3+!
.} Be8+ {} 83. Kb6 {The black king is now trapped in the wrong corner, which enables us to win the bishop after a couple of moves as the following sample line shows.} Ba4 {} 84. Rc4 {} Bb3 {84...Be8
85.Re4
Bd7
86.Rh4
also wins for White.} 85. Rb4 {} Ba2 {} 86. Rb2 {The bishop can no longer hide behind our king and is lost.} Bc4 {} 87. Rh2 {} Be6 {87...Kc8
88.Rc2} 88. Rh8+ {} Bc8 {} 89. Rg8 {} Ka8 {} 90. Rxc8 {} 


