[FEN "8/3kbR2/8/3K4/8/8/8/8 b - - 0 1"]
[Result "*"]

1. Kd8 {Picking the right square! Black is totally fine after this move because the bishop controls d6. It was important not to allow the enemy king to pick the opposing square on the sixth rank.
Black would, for instance, lose after
1...Ke8
2.Ke6
Bc5
3.Rc7
Bb6
4.Rc8+
Bd8
5.Ra8
.} 


