[FEN "rnbqkbnr/pppppppp/8/8/8/8/PPPPPPPP/RNBQKBNR w KQkq - 0 1"]
[Result "*"]

{The bishop is a selfless piece that can often sacrifice itself to let other pieces or pawns shine. This section showed us how we could block the diagonal, or create a second passed pawn to reach our goal in a bishop against bishop ending.  Exercises   The bishop won't last long in most of the exercises, but sacrifice it with care, as you can only lose it once! Luckily, you will often get a queen in return that decides the game for you.   Good luck!} 1. -- {} 


