{This section showed us how we can use the interference technique to obtain a decisive material advantage with our rook and bishop. In addition, we discussed how the eternal pin can be a powerful tool to paralyze an enemy piece and win it by means of zugzwang.   Exercises   It is now time to practice your new skills
(and the old ones!)
by solving the exercises! The final outcomes always produce a decisive advantage, but the remaining pieces and their positions on the board vary considerably.   Good luck!} 1. -- {} 


