{In this course I have taught you the most important tactical weapons available and did everything I could to help you implement them into your own games. Once you have trained, considered and most importantly tried out these techniques, my course objective will have been met.  You may be able to create situations in your own game where you could use the newly acquired skills to mate an enemy king or obtain a decisive material advantage. If you do, you can share your experiences and leave your thoughts in the comments and notes. This way the community can further learn and grow together.  Thank you and good luck!} 1. -- {} 

